WEBVTT

1
00:00:04.610 --> 00:00:10.513
Óskatímar (wished times): plans for
Besta – not bookings.

2
00:00:10.613 --> 00:00:13.516
Green: a wanted time.

3
00:00:13.616 --> 00:00:17.517
Yellow: allowed, but used last.

4
00:00:17.617 --> 00:00:23.521
Red: avoid – Besta uses it only
if nothing as good is free.

5
00:00:23.621 --> 00:00:29.524
Every other time stays possible:
wishes never forbid anything.

6
00:00:29.624 --> 00:00:35.730
Click to change: green → yellow
→ red → no colour.

7
00:00:35.830 --> 00:00:38.734
× takes a time off the list.

8
00:00:38.834 --> 00:00:44.737
Óskastofur (wished rooms): Besta
chooses only from this list.

9
00:00:44.837 --> 00:00:50.740
Green: wanted. Yellow: last resort.
Rooms have no red.

10
00:00:50.840 --> 00:00:55.743
A room that must not be used:
remove it with ×.

11
00:00:55.843 --> 00:01:01.745
The wishes come from the teachers'
survey – see module 3.

12
00:01:01.845 --> 00:01:05.748
Núllstilla (reset)
undoes it all.
